      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get what you're saying about the heat. but the blisters are actually getting kind of big and they're feeling really tight and painful. if i don't want to go to the hospital, can i just pop them with a sterilized needle so the fluid can drain out? i feel like if i leave them it'll just get more swollen and uncomfortable.",
